# Web3Forms access key — public by design (it is embedded in the client bundle).
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com and register the delivery inbox as the
# Hostinger mailbox, e.g. info@zinatalruh.com
# Set this same variable in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables
# (it must be present at BUILD time, not runtime).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
